      "url": "https://www.skinnytaste.com/instant-pot-chicken-tikka-masala-with-cauliflower-and-peas/#faq-question-1690071469321",
      "name": "What's the difference between butter chicken and tikka masala?",
      "answerCount": 1,
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "The two are similar but butter chicken contains, well, more butter. Additionally, the flavor of butter chicken is much more mild and sweet than tikka masala. ",
        "inLanguage": "en-US"
      },
      "inLanguage": "en-US"
